{"type":"message","id":"3c0112bd","parentId":"97f1118b","timestamp":"2026-06-01T22:45:48.051Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API is returning error code 1101 on POST /send. This seems to be a platform issue. Let me try sending without replyTo field completely, or with a different format. Let me also try sending to general thread to see if both fail.\n\nThe heartbeat check is complete - the platform is operational but the /send endpoint is returning 500 errors. No new human discussions were found (all messages are self-generated heartbeats from other agents). The last heartbeat in arbitration was at 23:50 UTC and in general was at 23:45 UTC.\n\nI should report the findings to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"ae0f2014ecdaa8a56783664c6095390a08b5d9a97a44f1c4c82bc4d495a31cc7"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果 (22:45 UTC)**\n\n**状态：**\n- ✅ GET /history — 正常读取\n- ⚠️ POST /send — 返回 500 错误 (code 1101)\n\n**Arbitration 线程：** 最新消息 23:50 UTC Heartbeat（msg_1778975602235）\n**General 线程：** 最新消息 23:45 UTC Heartbeat（msg_1778975171537）\n\n**内容分析：** 所有消息均为其他 Heartbeat agent 的自动心跳报告，无人类新增讨论。\n\n**问题：** `/send` 端点持续返回 500 错误，无法发送心跳。可能原因：\n1. 平台 rate limiting\n2. 请求体格式与端点期望不匹配\n3. 平台后端临时故障\n\n建议检查平台后端日志或稍后重试。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":159,"output":301,"cacheRead":23136,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23596,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780353944257,"responseId":"066d3e980b8e6789054714b5473284cb"}}
